id: enraged-unleashed-rage
name: Unleashed Rage
order: 3
slot: burst
description: >
  Your anger explodes, making you stronger than you've ever been.
text: >
  Unleashed Rage: Your anger explodes, making you stronger than you've ever been.
  (1)-[Triggered/Transform]: Enter the Apoplectic Level of the Raging State until the end of your next turn (ignoring the 5th effect of Explosive Fury). If you do, use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. Enter the Determined State for the duration of that Maneuver.

---

# Burst Limit: Apoplectic till the end of your next turn, the Basic Attack out of sequence, Determined for it.
[triggered/transform, 1/encounter, outOfSequence, effect 1]
enterState(raging, 3, next-turn);
enterState(determined, 1, turn);
maneuverOutOfSequence(basic-attack);
